# OIDC self-upgrade/reconfigure test chain — runs serially on the same Hub.
#
# Workflow:
#   1. zitadel/default            (provides DEPLOYER_OIDC_* in oidc_default stack)
#   2. enable HTTPS + OIDC        (Hub HTTP → HTTPS+OIDC)
#   3. upgrade Hub                (image-bump while HTTPS+OIDC stays on)
#   4. disable HTTPS + OIDC       (Hub HTTPS+OIDC → HTTP)
#
# Invocation:
#   /livetest --config <instance> @e2e/oidc-self-suite.lst
#
# Each `--config`-run starts with step2b rollback → fresh Hub-LXC without
# OIDC. Tests run serially via depends_on. ~25–30 min total.
zitadel/default
proxvex/self-reconfigure-enable-https-oidc
proxvex/self-upgrade-via-clone-with-oidc
proxvex/self-reconfigure-disable-https-oidc
